{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04077","headline":"恩制尚书省僚宴昆明池同用尧字 · 苏頲","name":"恩制尚书省僚宴昆明池同用尧字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露渥洒云霄，天官次斗杓。\n昆明四十里，空水极晴朝。\n雁似衔红叶，鲸疑喷海潮。\n翠山来彻底，白日去廻标。\n泳广渔杈溢，浮深妓舫摇。\n饱恩皆醉止，合舞共歌尧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}